{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_09_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_09","title":"笃信者","storyCode":"SV-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d0f4734312036462775b547c3690eff23b319d32e94fe60a0beb78df50960016","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，动得了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚。克制那种感觉......难。我好难不去想那些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的手指没法动。我一动，我的指甲就好像都会从我手上游走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神经细胞在急速新陈代谢，始终记住，你是个猎人，它们动不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么想有用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想成为海嗣，你就不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......我能拿起武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"没有武器的杂种，重伤的杂种，感染的杂种，你们能做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你那表情是什么意思？开始觉得自己高贵了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，奇怪......你会错意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你别以为那个海嗣让我有些难过，你就也配了。砍死你就完事儿了。 ​"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真以为箱子里是萨克斯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小美人鱼，你还要睡多久？睁眼。过去的事情困不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"......她也只是个试验品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼，你早醒了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......这么高浓度的源石液都......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你的老样子真不错，鲨鱼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。我都快忘了她是这个性子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，手还是好麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛混了这么几年，这点准备我还是做得好的。接着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"就不能让我再害羞会儿吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"做了那么长时间乖巧的修道女，我都不知道该怎么面对你俩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出来吧。别玩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么长时间过去，我也不知道自己是习惯现在的你，还是疯疯癫癫又有点自闭的那个了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，好硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲨鱼，回来！他已经是海嗣了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二队长，幽灵鲨......先离开这！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......孽种......毁灭——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教的身体极速膨胀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他的身体舒展开来，溶洞的岩壁在他长须的挥舞下竟陡然碎裂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"太......高估......自己的命运......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教的头颅自他双眼正中开放。\n眼皮从它巨硕的双眼上褪下，玻璃体反射出了猎人们倒退的身影。\n而无数触肢更飞速从它原本瘦削矮小的身体里奔流而出，甩向这些它原本不屑一顾的蜉蝣。\n海水涌入了溶洞，随着主教身体的膨大不断上涨。\n主教扭动着打碎了所有仪器，它的身形几近海嗣，却又发泄着人类的狂怒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘈杂而急促的抽动声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会长得这么大？他是怎么把那么多肉塞在这个身体里的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你看，他的头还能分开。记住，右边的头给我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（神经相互叠合挤压出的声响）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们怎么都这么急吼吼的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（类似说话的模拟人声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动作慢，猎物就会逃走，或者很快就会死在别的猎人手上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（急剧晃动骨骼的声音）......你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（液泡被戳破的声音）......孽种......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧那人，气急败坏，连个成型的句子都吐不出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算人了。这种猎物只在猎人狩猎它的时候才有价值。走！向上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"什......么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"地在晃......海岸旁的山？是不是有东西在掉下来？窗户这边可以看见。那是......教堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——屋子也晃个不停，我的盒子，食物......佩特拉奶奶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特拉奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位，现在都请跟我一起到外面去！留在室内会有危险——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我跟你们废话干什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，审判官......一把抱起了佩特拉奶奶？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你也别愣着了，我知道你能听懂！这房子有多老了，你心里没数吗？随便震一震都要塌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"不管教堂里现在怎样，就那几位都过去了，搞不好还有......哎！待会会发生什么我都保证不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"墙灰，砖头，石柱，壁炉叔！拉住我的手！墙灰你再拉几个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"跟着审判官......我们先出去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"总算，人应该都在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"山......教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"教士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"倒还惦记着那披着皮的异教分子？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"真是完全不知道谁把你们害成了这样......呃......哎，算了！你，你不许往前走了！你给我回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特拉奶奶","speakerId":"avg_npc_179","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶......睁开了眼睛？我在这里，奶奶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"石、石块！房顶落下来的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，审判官帮我们挡下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特拉奶奶在看着你，审判官，她在感谢你哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就抓着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官，你流血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......刚才挨那一下砸，还有点疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"你也帮我打过恐鱼。就当交换了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，我为什么要在这里......你们明明连害怕都不懂。性命受到威胁都不知道逃跑，这还算活着么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"那个歌......在我脑子里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官，歌手她不在这里，会不会有问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"有问题......呵，我知道你的有问题不是那种有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果她是那样的，那她就算有问题，这个问题的答案也不会太烂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"要结果的话，就等吧。要不她真能......给一个好答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要冲进教堂了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"它可没停下来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"触须向上扬去，将掉落的岩块一一击打成粉末，迸射在岩壁上的石子竟然把岩壁打出了裂痕。\n幽灵鲨的圆锯滋滋作响。触须靠近她的一瞬间，这个“修女”的嘴角微微翘起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"有多久没对付你这种猎物了？我都有点馋啦。"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽灵鲨双臂一横，锯柄撞击在岩壁上，坚固的花岗岩被撞出一个大坑。\n借助冲力，幽灵鲨轻飘飘地翻身。与此同时，圆锯却在她身体下方划出一道沉重的灰色轨迹，与触须交错而过。\n刺耳的切割声响起，触须应声而断。\n发丝上窜的“修女”摸上一块原本是楼梯的东西，用力一推，继续向教堂奔去。\n她注视着触须的断面，几支细小的幼芽从那接近透明的白色中探出头来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"听啊，它体内的细胞在尖叫。很像我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它有感情，它原本是个阿戈尔人......也不。不再是了。以前也算不上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物触手末端上的苞芽突然绽放，数道尖锐的液体狠狠地刺向了三个猎人。\n斯卡蒂调转剑柄，大剑被她像盾一样压在身下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三道水箭撞在剑身上，斯卡蒂被猛地上推数米，四溅的水花刺进了岩壁，穿射出了细小的孔洞......然后蒸发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的水流比我工作台上用的水刀流速都快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"它在看我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想办法，这东西会这么无限长下去吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“主教”那巨硕的双眼忽地放出了异样的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能量？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在这时，歌蕾蒂娅的长槊飞速地划过“主教”的视觉器官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一层坚硬的“膜”立刻覆盖在怪物的双眼上，长槊的刃尖在覆膜上划出了一道长痕。\n怪物不满地嘶嚎，歌蕾蒂娅却在爆炸般的声响中向上弹去。\n还差一点，就是建筑底部。教堂地面早已被她们的搏斗震碎，离她们撞上教堂穹顶，也只剩几秒。\n歌蕾蒂娅却放缓了速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"剑鱼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了。它的体型和重量，到这里也就差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"你对我做的这一切，让你现在就这么还了......真是便宜了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让它逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是够了。闹得这么大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的猎人算不在你头上，主教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这一剑，这剑是为了你们曾经害死的我的家人，我的朋友。海里的，陆地上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死吧，混蛋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，死吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_143_ghost","aliases":["幽灵鲨"]}]}
